  "title": "2022 Hobie Mirage Oasis",
  "handle": "2022-hobie-mirage-oasis-1283",
  "descriptionHtml": "<div><span><strong><span>Save Big on our Prior Model Year Clearance!</span></strong><br /><span><span>All boats are new and come with a full warranty starting on their purchase date!</span></span></p><p><strong><span>2025 Models can be found <a href=\"https://www.questwatersports.com/2024-hobie-mirage-oasis--c-879.htm\">here</a> and will be available once delivered from Hobie</p><p>Financing Available*!</span></strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div>The Oasis is stretched-out and spacious; the more performance-oriented of Hobie's pair of tandems powered by the elegant, easy-to-use MirageDrive. So speedy, yet boasting a robust carrying capacity suitable for a weekend camping trip or fishing with enough gear to stock a tackle shop - there are four convenient hatches and a generous on-deck storage area, as well as molded-in rod holders. The Oasis gets the job done in style and comfort.</p><p>Length: 14' 6\" / 4.42 m<br />Width: 33\" / .84 m<br />Hull Weight: 93 lbs / 42 kg<br />Fully Rigged Weight: 127 lbs / 58 kg<br />Capacity: 550 lbs / 249 kg<br />Crew: 1-2</p><p>*Must be approved by Synchrony Financial with a large enough credit line to cover the purchase price. Call (815) 433-2200 for more info</div><div>&nbsp;</div><p>Two Molded-In Rod Holders\nDual-Position Steering\nLarge Twist and Stow Rudder\nSail Mount\nTwo-Piece Paddles with On-Hull Storage\nTwo MirageDrive 180s with ST Fins\nVantage CT Seating\nTwo Mesh-Covered Stowage Pockets\nThree 8\" Twist and Seal Hatches with Gear Bucket</p>",
